{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q422606","formula":"C₁₀H₁₂N₄O₃","hill":"C10H12N4O3","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":12.0,"N":4.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Didanosine","uk":"Диданозин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Didanosine (ddI), sold under the brand name Videx among others, is a medication used to treat HIV/AIDS. It is used in combination with other medications as part of highly active antiretroviral therapy (HAART). It is of the reverse-transcriptase inhibitor class. Didanosine was first described in 1975 and approved for use in the United States in 1991.","uk":"Диданози́н (англ. ddI) — синтетичний противірусний препарат з групи нуклеозидних інгібіторів зворотньої транскриптази для прийому всередину. Уперше проліки диданозину — 2′,3′-дидеоксиаденозин — синтезовано у 1964 році науковцями Університету Бригама Янга Моррісом Робінсом і Р. К. Робінсом."},"fame":21,"pubchemCid":50599,"mass":236.23,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1C[C@@H](O[C@@H]1CO)N2C=NC3=C2NC=NC3=O","inchikey":"BXZVVICBKDXVGW-NKWVEPMBSA-N","iupac":"9-[(2R,5S)-5-(hydroxymethyl)oxolan-2-yl]-3H-purin-6-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"50599","atoms":29,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.31,"y":-0.12,"z":-0.772,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.767,"y":1.193,"z":-1.225,"el":"O"},{"x":4.111,"y":1.647,"z":0.343,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.054,"y":-0.077,"z":-0.05,"el":"N"},{"x":1.799,"y":-1.585,"z":-0.517,"el":"N"},{"x":1.163,"y":1.745,"z":0.437,"el":"N"},{"x":3.977,"y":-0.583,"z":-0.284,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.23,"y":-0.922,"z":-0.26,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.727,"y":-1.611,"z":1.008,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.943,"y":-0.799,"z":1.391,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.471,"y":-0.368,"z":0.035,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.337,"y":0.875,"z":0.089,"el":"C"},{"x":1.249,"y":-0.416,"z":-0.174,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.058,"y":1.248,"z":0.325,"el":"C"},{"x":1.983,"y":0.